      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Renaming `file` to `observedDir` (clearer intent)\n2. Consolidating the builder setup with `setFile` at construction time\n3. Adding meaningful assertion messages explaining the non-obvious `\"true\"` in the expected output\n4. Adding a brief comment clarifying why `\"true\"` appears (it's `TrueFileFilter`'s `toString()`)\n5. Removing all unused importsNow I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully."
